# Authentication for the Fabric REST API.
#
# The analyzer acquires a bearer token for the Fabric scope
# (https://api.fabric.microsoft.com/.default) using, in order:
#   1. FABRIC_TOKEN (if set) — a raw bearer token you paste in.
#   2. Azure CLI credential — run `az login` first.
#   3. Device code credential — requires FABRIC_CLIENT_ID (+ optional FABRIC_TENANT_ID).

# Option 1: paste a raw bearer token (e.g. from `az account get-access-token`).
# FABRIC_TOKEN=

# Option 3: device-code interactive login with your own Entra app registration.
# FABRIC_CLIENT_ID=
# FABRIC_TENANT_ID=
